      "start": 164,
      "end": 167,
      "quote": "子籍。",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "南21僧祐傳末明言「子籍」。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 95,
      "start": 4,
      "end": 8,
      "quote": "遠子 籍",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "南21數位編者題與本傳正文及梁50父祖不同。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 97,
      "start": 5,
      "end": 11,
      "quote": "仕齊爲余杭令",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "余杭與餘姚是兩縣。南史繫齊。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 97,
      "start": 42,
      "end": 47,
      "quote": "又爲錢唐縣",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "南史用錢唐，對其為政評甚高。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 99,
      "start": 51,
      "end": 72,
      "quote": "梁天監中，爲輕車湘東王諮議參軍，隨府會稽郡",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "南史繫天監；帝紀初任會稽之軍號另作寧遠。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 99,
      "start": 86,
      "end": 98,
      "quote": "蟬噪林逾靜，鳥鳴山更幽。",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "兩史詩句相合。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 99,
      "start": 99,
      "end": 116,
      "quote": "劉孺見之，擊節不能已已。以公事免。",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "南史具劉孺和免官。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 101,
      "start": 40,
      "end": 46,
      "quote": "後爲作唐侯相",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "南史作唐侯相，梁本作塘令；尊重兩種職文。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 101,
      "start": 71,
      "end": 75,
      "quote": "未幾而卒",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "皆言短時；無享年。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi021-ws1752646.wikitext",
      "revision": 1752646,
      "line": 101,
      "start": 96,
      "end": 106,
      "quote": "湘東王集其文爲十卷云",
      "sha256": "d377274faea65e6901368f9d913e639bbbbc6fe6080a173be2b258e8bcfad718",
      "note": "湘東王輯王籍文十卷；與王籍輯友人謝徵文二十卷分辨。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi019-xie-branches/liang003-ws2401780.wikitext",
      "revision": 2401780,
      "line": 135,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20,
      "quote": "冬十月辛未，以丹陽尹、湘東王繹爲荊州刺史",
      "sha256": "e9234a36260579030fbd45ef5581f24b4d2ed95c07818d4ee2becfa99a41b3eb",
      "note": "普通七年（526）湘東王初鎮荊州，此時尚未號安西。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi019-xie-branches/liang003-ws2401780.wikitext",
      "revision": 2401780,
      "line": 231,
      "start": 41,
      "end": 59,
      "quote": "西中郎將、荊州刺史湘東王繹爲平西將軍",
      "sha256": "e9234a36260579030fbd45ef5581f24b4d2ed95c07818d4ee2becfa99a41b3eb",
      "note": "中大通四年（532）平西，和名簿平西將軍一致。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi019-xie-branches/liang003-ws2401780.wikitext",
      "revision": 2401780,
      "line": 288,
      "start": 75,
      "end": 97,
      "quote": "辛丑，平西將軍、荊州刺史湘東王繹進號安西將軍",
      "sha256": "e9234a36260579030fbd45ef5581f24b4d2ed95c07818d4ee2becfa99a41b3eb",
      "note": "大同元年十二月（535梁曆年）改號安西。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi019-xie-branches/liang003-ws2401780.wikitext",
      "revision": 2401780,
      "line": 326,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 24,
      "quote": "閏月甲子，安西將軍、荊州刺史湘東王繹進號鎮西將軍",
      "sha256": "e9234a36260579030fbd45ef5581f24b4d2ed95c07818d4ee2becfa99a41b3eb",
      "note": "大同三年閏月（537）改鎮西；前一期府號的上界。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/liangshu/liangshu005-ws2312810.wikitext",
      "revision": 2312810,
      "line": 11,
      "start": 27,
      "end": 53,
      "quote": "{{YL|天監七年}}八月丁巳生。十三年，封湘東郡王",
      "sha256": "8db54746cef2dcc177304ef83a2e0de6384208ce216a8794e7760cf604d853e1",
      "note": "繹生508，514封湘東郡王。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/liangshu/liangshu005-ws2312810.wikitext",
      "revision": 2312810,
      "line": 11,
      "start": 59,
      "end": 84,
      "quote": "初爲寧遠將軍、會稽太守，入爲侍中、宣威將軍、丹陽尹",
      "sha256": "8db54746cef2dcc177304ef83a2e0de6384208ce216a8794e7760cf604d853e1",
      "note": "帝紀在早期會稽任寫寧遠將軍，不照傳中輕車改字。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/liangshu/liangshu005-ws2312810.wikitext",
      "revision": 2312810,
      "line": 11,
      "start": 128,
      "end": 170,
      "quote": "{{YL|中大通四年}}，進號平西將軍。大同元年，進號安西將軍。三年，進號鎮西將軍。",
      "sha256": "8db54746cef2dcc177304ef83a2e0de6384208ce216a8794e7760cf604d853e1",
      "note": "補足武帝紀的年號。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/liang021-wangzhi/external/liangshu002-ws2401748.wikitext",
      "revision": 2401748,
      "line": 173,
      "start": 46,
      "end": 59,
      "quote": "江州刺史安成王秀爲平西將軍",
      "sha256": "7cfc6c0f26c1fa931664acd1f5519749ebb6ec6f11149df8b726f260174ebee2",
      "note": "安成王指蕭秀；籍為主簿、秀為府主。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/liang021-wangzhi/external/liangshu002-ws2401748.wikitext",
      "revision": 2401748,
      "line": 260,
      "start": 2,
      "end": 17,
      "quote": "閏月乙丑，特進、中軍將軍沈約卒",
      "sha256": "7cfc6c0f26c1fa931664acd1f5519749ebb6ec6f11149df8b726f260174ebee2",
      "note": "天監十二年（513），詠燭獲賞最晚在此之前。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/liang050-wangji/external/liang014-ws1494991.wikitext",
      "revision": 1494991,
      "line": 55,
      "start": 2,
      "end": 17,
      "quote": "六年春，出爲寧朔將軍、新安太守",
      "sha256": "bd55139f2465ae1ab442f8cf526e3172d0a6d31dd752789d235a69857556d1ec",
      "note": "承天監六年（507）。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/liang050-wangji/external/liang014-ws1494991.wikitext",
      "revision": 1494991,
      "line": 55,
      "start": 56,
      "end": 71,
      "quote": "視事朞歲，卒於官舍，時年四十九",
      "sha256": "bd55139f2465ae1ab442f8cf526e3172d0a6d31dd752789d235a69857556d1ec",
      "note": "任昉在新安約一年即卒，任昉稱籍大致以508為上界。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi019-xie-branches/liang050-ws1514482.wikitext",
      "revision": 1514482,
      "line": 114,
      "start": 150,
      "end": 178,
      "quote": "大同二年，卒官，時年三十七。友人琅邪王籍集其文爲二十卷。",
      "sha256": "46f17adb85a40252096bb10bb6b90ba40178ae6da293368629eded0273320cf8",
      "note": "同卷謝徵卒於536，其友王籍編謝徵文集二十卷，推王籍至少生存至536。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/liang050-wangji/external/guanghongmingji020-ws778962.wikitext",
      "revision": 778962,
      "line": 24,
      "start": 2,
      "end": 19,
      "quote": "梁簡文帝法寳聯璧序　　　　　梁元帝",
      "sha256": "cab2c7a51b3da300ee5532ef4d0028a33f4954990f9c2631a271253a101d7fc1",
      "note": "簡文帝的《法寶聯璧》，序的作者為其弟蕭繹。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/liang050-wangji/external/guanghongmingji020-ws778962.wikitext",
      "revision": 778962,
      "line": 25,
      "start": 1018,
      "end": 1027,
      "quote": "今歲次攝提星在監德",
      "sha256": "cab2c7a51b3da300ee5532ef4d0028a33f4954990f9c2631a271253a101d7fc1",
      "note": "攝提寅歲；平西職期內為534甲寅。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/liang050-wangji/external/guanghongmingji020-ws778962.wikitext",
      "revision": 778962,
      "line": 26,
      "start": 2,
      "end": 24,
      "quote": "使持節平西將軍荆州刺史湘東王繹年二十七字世誠",
      "sha256": "cab2c7a51b3da300ee5532ef4d0028a33f4954990f9c2631a271253a101d7fc1",
      "note": "534時湘東王按虛歲二十七，與508生互合。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/liang050-wangji/external/guanghongmingji020-ws778962.wikitext",
      "revision": 778962,
      "line": 34,
      "start": 22,
      "end": 37,
      "quote": "中散大夫瑯琊王藉年五十五字文海",
      "sha256": "cab2c7a51b3da300ee5532ef4d0028a33f4954990f9c2631a271253a101d7fc1",
      "note": "四庫本作藉。籍貫、官、字均合王籍。五十五是編纂當時所報生前年齡。"
    }
  ],
